# Clustering artifacts — keep the large uncompressed copies out of git.
#
# The two files that matter are committed here, gzipped:
#
#   container.tsv.gz       pipeline INPUT  — dump of the works database
#                          (../get_view.php, _design/source)
#   container_docs.json.gz pipeline OUTPUT — reload with couch_push.php
#
# Both are committed rather than regenerated because every step upstream of them
# depends on a populated works database, so neither is reproducible once that
# database is wiped or rebuilt from different sources. import.php and the restore
# instructions read the .gz directly; the plain files below are just working
# copies, regenerable from the .gz or from a live database.
container.tsv
containers.db
containers.db-shm
containers.db-wal
clusters.tsv
clusters_multi.tsv
clusters_multi.html
container_docs.json
